-python runtime/tests/test_tiny_model.py runtime/build/glide-logits
-python runtime/tests/test_grouped_noncausal.py runtime/build/glide-logits runtime/build/glide-test-attention-control
-python runtime/tests/test_source_verification.py
-```
-
-The basic synthetic two-layer model includes one recurrent and one full-attention layer. A second, deeper model uses [recurrent, full, recurrent, full] layers with 2 key heads and 6 value heads in its GDN layers, reproducing the production 1:3 grouping ratio at smaller scale. Tests verify:
